OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fshowery during this evening, these
OL,7,Fheaviest and most widespread in the
OL,8,Fwest. The showers becoming more
OL,9,Fscattered overnight with clearer
OL,10,Fspells. Breezy, strong winds around
OL,11,Fthe north coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA bright day with sunny spells
OL,14,Fand a scattering of showers. The
OL,15,Fshowers dying back towards the west
OL,16,Fcoast during the afternoon, then
OL,17,Fmainly dry through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
